Explanation

1. In `_handleReceivedMessageFromTarget` we only forwarded sub-target messages whose method started with `"Network"`.  
2. By also forwarding `"Page"` events, iframe lifecycle events (firstContentfulPaint, loadEventFired, etc.) get recorded in the same DevtoolsLog used for the main frame.
3. Because our `DevtoolsLog` is already configured to record `/^(Page|Network)\./`, those iframe Page events will enter the trace and no longer be dropped.
4. Down-stream metrics (which derive from the trace) will then automatically include iframe costs rather than ignore them.
